<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Compaq purchase of Tandem.</title>
<headline>EU clears Compaq purchase of Tandem.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS, Belgium 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said Tuesday cleared the acquisition by U.S. computer maker Compaq Computer Corp. of Tandem Computers.</p>
<p>The EU executive said it found the &quot;overlaps between the two companies' activities ... were not such as to give rise to competition concerns.&quot;</p>
<p>The commission routinely reviews mergers involving companies that operate in the European Union to determine whether competition will be affected.</p>
<p>Compaq is one of the world's largest supplier of personal computer products.</p>
<p>Tandem makes highly specialised computer systems for operations in banks, stock exchanges and telecommunications.</p>
</text>
